<!-- ============================ BEGINNER GUIDE ============================
  This is the TEAM page. It has TWO branches you switch between with the tabs at the top:
    • Seniors '28 (Current) — the grid with id="teamGrid". Each person is a "member-card" that
      shows a real PHOTO. The picture files live in the team_images/ folder; the card's img src
      points at the exact file name. To change a photo, drop the new image into team_images/ and
      update that person's img src (each card has a comment naming the person).
    • Seniors '26 (Alumni) — the second "team-branch" grid. These cards have NO photo; they show
      a circle with the person's initials instead. To edit, just change the name/role text.
